: on average 4.2 m from the centre, 9 times wider than at the opening."},{"t":null,"title":"Who covers the most ground","text":"Sueda walks 79 m, Esin 61 m."},{"t":null,"title":"Hard to follow","text":"The camera loses Esin for 72 s, Mina for only 8 s. Those moments stay out of the colour map."},{"t":null,"title":"The line-up","text":"Seen from the audience, left to right, the usual order is Esin · Lidya · Mina · Zeynep · Sueda · Hilal. It hardly changes all song."},{"t":null,"title":"Centre stage","text":"Sueda is the one closest to the centre line in 49% of the moments when all six are visible."},{"t":null,"title":"Closest to the crowd","text":"Hilal is the one nearest the audience 44% of the time."},{"t":null,"title":"Always side by side","text":"Esin & Lidya and Hilal & Zeynep are each other's nearest neighbour most of the song."}],"rel_samples":61}